        "b": 689.99625
      },
      "content": "the screen display). Press the knob. Set-up menu displays."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0498",
      "reading_order": 541,
      "section": "4.2 Service Menu",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 675.75375,
        "r": 537.2627499999998,
        "b": 649.49625
      },
      "content": "Rotate  the  knob  to  highlight  Service  Menu  in  the  Set-up  menu, and then press the knob to access the Service Menu."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0499",
      "reading_order": 542,
      "section": "4.2 Service Menu",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 635.25375,
        "r": 440.0625,
        "b": 622.49625
      },
      "content": "Three digits displays in the Level 2 Menu as shown in Figure 5."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0500",
      "reading_order": 543,
      "section": "4.2 Service Menu",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 160.5,
        "t": 609.0525,
        "r": 519.5625,
        "b": 595.49625
      },
      "content": "Note: The access code is 4 , 0 , 2 . It is set at the factory and may not be changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0501",
      "reading_order": 544,
      "section": "4.2 Service Menu",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 581.25375,
        "r": 538.8127000000003,
        "b": 541.49625
      },
      "content": "Rotate the knob to highlight the top of the digits. Press the knob to enter the access code. The digit turns yellow. This indicates that it is ready to rotate the knob in order to change the digit."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0502",
      "reading_order": 545,
      "section": "4.2 Service Menu",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 527.25375,
        "r": 404.8125,
        "b": 514.49625
      },
      "content": "Rotate the knob until '4' appears, then press the knob."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0503",
      "reading_order": 546,
      "section": "4.2 Service Menu",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 501.0525,
        "r": 421.3125,
        "b": 487.49625
      },
      "content": "Repeat step 5-6 to enter all the access code ' 4 ' ' 0 ' ' 2 '."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0504",
      "reading_order": 547,
      "section": "4.2 Service Menu",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 248.25374999999997,
        "r": 539.0624000000003,
        "b": 208.49625000000003
      },
      "content": "The  Service Menu  will  now  be  present.  The  available  Service  Menu  items  are explained in  Figure 6 and  Table 9. Make changes to these menu items as desired by rotating and pressing the knob."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0505",
      "reading_order": 548,
      "section": "4.2 Service Menu",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 194.25374999999997,
        "r": 537.8132499999999,
        "b": 167.99625000000003
      },
      "content": "Select 'YES' on 'Save Current Values as Power-On Default' if any changes of the setting become power-on defaults."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0033",
